# Tooltip delay (강제)

## Policy

- Mouse-hover tooltips open after **600ms** (`delayDuration={600}`).
- Do not force instant tooltips (`delayDuration={0}`) or other custom delays.

## SSOT

- `web/frontend/src/components/ui/tooltip.tsx` — `TooltipProvider` default `delayDuration = 600`
- `web/frontend/src/App.tsx` — root provider
- `web/frontend/rules.md` — Tooltip section

## Do / Don't

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — instant or one-off delay
<TooltipProvider delayDuration={0}>
<Tooltip delayDuration={200}>

// ✅ GOOD — inherit app default (600ms)
<TooltipProvider>
<Tooltip>
```
